  "id": "storytelling",
  "term": "storytelling",
  "definition": "In this context, storytelling refers to creating and sharing personal narratives, especially digital stories about important life, health, illness, or care experiences. It is used to help people learn from lived experience, share knowledge, build connection, support advocacy, and sometimes provide a therapeutic outlet for the person telling the story.",
